WEBVTT

00:00:09,010 --> 00:00:20,690
I am using a product to increase GHK copper, which is supposed to increase pluripotent

00:00:20,690 --> 00:00:22,090
stem cell production.

00:00:22,090 --> 00:00:29,490
Will this increase stem cancer, stem cell production as well?

00:00:29,490 --> 00:00:36,170
So GHK is peptide therapy?

00:00:36,170 --> 00:00:48,450
So it can increase growth and increase mitochondrial function, so I would not personally use this.

00:00:48,450 --> 00:00:57,330
I am not in favor of peptide therapy with cancer patients.

00:00:57,330 --> 00:01:04,250
To me, it doesn't make sense to me, you are greatly increasing the survival ship of a cancer

00:01:04,250 --> 00:01:06,250
cell.

00:01:06,250 --> 00:01:16,410
If anything is going to be stimulating growth and health of cells per se, it can stimulate

00:01:16,410 --> 00:01:22,450
cancer replication and can stimulate health of cancer cells.

00:01:22,450 --> 00:01:31,890
The same reason why you typically wouldn't use glutathione and antioxidants with cancer,

00:01:31,890 --> 00:01:35,410
same concept, I would say no to this.

